              }
            },
            {
              "label": "2. Amide conjugation",
              "text": "<p>Nitrogen donates lone-pair electron density into the carbonyl system. The C–N bond has partial double-bond character; amide nitrogen is much less basic than a typical amine.</p>",
              "molecule": "acetamide",
              "highlights": {
                "path": [
